Revision history for RT-Extension-BeautifyUI

2.2.0  2026-05-04
  - Integrated FeedWidget (RSS/ATOM feed reader dashboard widget)
  - Per-user feed configuration on Prefs/AboutMe.html (FormEnd callback)
  - Server-side feed fetching via LWP::UserAgent + XML::LibXML
  - 15-minute session cache per feed URL
  - Tab-based multi-feed display; adapts to all RT 6 themes
  - HTMX-powered preferences form (no page reload on save)
  - FeedWidget auto-registered in HomepageComponents
  - ReferrerComponents for feed endpoints applied automatically in BeautifyUI.pm
  - Absorbs RT-Extension-FeedWidget standalone

2.1.0  2026-05-03
  - Added LinkedArticles ticket display widget
  - html/Ticket/Widgets/Display/LinkedArticles: widget registration with
    PreCheck method hiding the widget when no articles are linked
  - html/Ticket/Elements/ShowLinkedArticles: Bootstrap card list of linked
    articles (name, class badge, summary); auto-refreshes via HTMX on
    ticketLinksChanged event
  - Makefile.PL: minimum RT version raised from 5.0.0 to 6.0.2

2.0.0  2026-04-28
  - Mega-consolidation: absorbs six formerly standalone extensions
  - Integrated ClockWidget (flip clock dashboard widget)
  - Integrated WeatherWidget (live Open-Meteo weather, 12 language PO files)
  - Integrated ArticlesWidget (5 newest knowledge-base articles)
  - Integrated AssetsWidget (5 most recently updated active assets with Held By)
  - Integrated UserProfileWidget (profile card with gradient banner, avatar,
    contact info)
  - Integrated TodaysHolidays dashboard widget and login-page banner
    (holidays-worldwide.csv with ~280 entries, rt-update-public-holidays script)
  - All HomepageComponents registered automatically in BeautifyUI.pm
  - Added etc/BeautifyUI_Config.pm.sample covering WeatherWidget and
    HolidaysCSVPath options
  - VERSION bumped to 2.0.0

1.0.0  2026-04-28
  - Initial release — consolidates all local UI/design enhancements
  - Bootstrap Icons 1.11.3 loaded globally via CDN
  - Section icons on ticket, asset and article display widgets
  - Coloured icons for the main navigation menu
  - ColumnMap/Once: owner colour (red=nobody, green=self), status+NewReply
    badge, due-date and SLA coloured badges, pending-ticket badge,
    avatar thumbnails for requestor/CC/AdminCC columns
  - AfterDue callback: due-date colour coding on ticket display widget
  - EndOfList callback: SLA colour coding on ticket display widget
  - Article card styling (hover accent, 2-line summary clamp, empty state)
  - Action-results and dependency-status banner styling
  - Priority badge colours (low/medium/high/on_fire)
  - Compatible with RT 5.0+ / RT 6
